OL,3,AMiliband rejects chief rabbi's claim
OL,4,ABritish Jews in greater danger after
OL,5,Asanctions move
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We all need to do more to tackle
OL,8,Fantisemitism," Miliband said, "but I
OL,9,Fbelieve we can do that and stand up for
OL,10,FBritish values".
OL,12,FThe sanctions on trade with illegal
OL,13,Fsettlements in the occupied West Bank
OL,14,Fcome against a backdrop of rising
OL,15,Fantisemitic incidents across the UK.
